  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been trying to create a PhysBone script/chain that will let me grab a set of sunglasses and put them on my head or peer over them, etc. Except I don't want the collider for the sunglasses to be the size of my head, and I don't want the center of that collider to snap to the middle of my hand when I grab them (especially when I can't offset the collider like you can with contacts). I want to be able to grab either side of the glasses like a normal person and have that remain the attachment point until I let go, and without having to create this weird daisy chain that makes them go all off-kilter when I grab them. I have to believe there are other reasons someone would want to specify the grabbing point(s) for a physbone being off of the center of mass (hats, anyone?), but yeah. This would be great, please.",
